- These are the members of a `Dereferenceable`, for a record of type `T` dereferenced `to R`:
+ Estos son los miembros de un `Dereferenceable`, para un registro de tipo `T` desreferenciado
+ `to R`:

= These are the members of a `Dereferenceable`, for a record of type `T` dereferenced `to R`:
=
- ```tabular
+ ```tabular

- column  Member
- column  Returns
- row  `names(record)`  the field names
